OL,3,AHow That's Life gave Esther Rantzen a
OL,4,Acareer-defining moment
OL,5,
OL,6,FDame Esther Rantzen's commitment to
OL,7,Fcharitable causes is something she will
OL,8,Fforever be remembered for.
OL,10,FAlong with founding Childline, a
OL,11,Fhelpline for children, and The Silver
OL,12,FLine, which supports older people
OL,13,Fstruggling with loneliness, she also
OL,14,Fcreated a broadcasting legacy during
OL,15,Fher time on That's Life.
OL,17,FShe presented the hugely popular BBC
OL,18,FOne show from 1973 to 1994, helping
OL,19,Ftransform it from a consumer rights
OL,20,Fprogramme to an issues-based series,
OL,21,Fdrawing in huge audiences.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
